*> vybe-test: cobol/nested_programs/test_nested_program_structure
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_nested_programs.rs

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. OUTERPROG.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC X(5) VALUE "OUTER".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY WS-A.
    CALL "INNERPROG".
    STOP RUN.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INNERPROG.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-B PIC X(5) VALUE "INNER".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY WS-B.
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM INNERPROG.

END PROGRAM OUTERPROG.

